#: ../../Filtration/Filtration_Design.rst:70
msgid "Inlet Channel Design for Equal Filter Flow"
msgstr "Diseño del canal de entrada para un flujo de filtro igual"

#: ../../Filtration/Filtration_Design.rst:72
msgid ""
"We will simplify this manifold problem by assuming that the average water "
"height in the channel above the weirs corresponds to the average flow across"
" the weirs and that the upstream depth is decreased by 1/2 of the channel "
"velocity head and the downstream depth is increased by 1/2 the channel "
"velocity head."
msgstr ""
"Simplificaremos este problema del colector asumiendo que la altura media del"
" agua en el canal por encima de las presas corresponde al caudal medio a "
"través de las presas y que la profundidad aguas arriba se reduce en 1/2 de "
"la altura de velocidad del canal y la profundidad aguas abajo aumenta en 1/2"
" la altura de velocidad del canal."

